                            <comment id="472352" author="emoly.liu" created="Mon, 22 Sep 2025 03:22:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rread&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rread&quot;&gt;rread&lt;/a&gt; ,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;Would these functions work on any client, like&#160;&lt;tt&gt;llapi_hsm_copytool_register()&lt;/tt&gt;?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I have added a new RPC MDS_CHANGELOG_GET_USER_INFO in &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19296&quot; title=&quot;changelog processing should use per-user state&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-19296&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-19296&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; to get changelog user information from MDT to client for changelog filtering. Next, I will improve these APIs with new RPCs, then they will work on client.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
